## solutions

#### iterative

```cpp
#include <string>

bool linkedListFind(Node* head, std::string target) {
  Node* current = head;
  while (current != nullptr) {
    if (current->val == target) {
      return true;
    }
    current = current->next;
  }
  return false;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```cpp
#include <string>

bool linkedListFind(Node* head, std::string target) {
  if (head == nullptr) {
    return false;
  }

  if (head->val == target) {
    return true;
  }

  return linkedListFind(head->next, target);
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
